    "meta": {
      "title": "Velvet Voltage",
      "author": "Ady & Codex",
      "description": "Original emotional future-funk / 16-bit fusion. A recurring 3+3+2 melodic cell, D-minor/Dorian colour, chromatic slap-bass pickups, half-time reharmonisation, a bass-and-clavinet break, and a final whole-step lift. 144 BPM, 104 bars."
